  "description": "Codex: Orks (11e) DAKKASTORM (Kult of Speed) through the real unit_selected_to_shoot WINDOW. Setup-only: P1 switched to Kult of Speed, Custodian Guard C moved unengaged in front of the Ork rank with inflated wounds, defender auto-allocates. A real click on the Deffkoptas (SPEED FREEKS) token opens the StratagemDialog with an enabled 'Use on Deffkoptas'. A real click spends 1 CP; the forecast shows SH 1. Quick-Assign + Confirm + Fast resolve the Deffkoptas' guns: the hit roll carries [SUSTAINED HITS 1] with one bonus hit per critical hit.",
